# the event pool FULL while recording ("4 instruments recorded, no 5th would record"): it must never be silent.
# (1) the oldest take of the fullest clip goes (one undo step), the new take records; (2) nothing to drop: the notes
# that did not fit are lost with a message, and the take recorded so far stays
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
qnt 0
# a pool nearly full of old layers (4 takes of notes in part H's track 6)
ballast 4084 4
wait 100
expect nev 4084
tap REC
wait 3500
expect recording 1
key w0 down 90
key w2 down 90
key w4 down 90
wait 500
key w0 up
key w2 up
key w4 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 500
expect recording 0
# the chord is in (all 12 events of the passes so far, none lost): the ballast's oldest take went for it
expect events >11
expect nev <4097
shot recfull_dropped.png
# 5 more takes: each one records, the pool stays inside its limit
tap REC
wait 3500
key w1 down 90
wait 300
key w1 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 500
expect events >14
tap REC
wait 3500
key w3 down 90
wait 300
key w3 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 500
expect events >17
expect nev <4097
